<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admin Dashboard | Car Deals</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="role-shell">
        <aside class="role-sidebar admin-sidebar">
            <a class="brand-mark" href="/admin"><span class="brand-icon">CD</span><span>Car Deals<small>Admin control</small></span></a>
            <p class="sidebar-label">Control room</p>
            <nav class="sidebar-nav" aria-label="Admin navigation">
                <a class="sidebar-link active" href="/admin">Overview</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/employees">Employees</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/clients">Clients</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/car_types">Car types</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/suppliers">Suppliers</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/sales">Sales</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/latest">Latest additions</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/add-user">Add user</a>
            </nav>
            <a class="sidebar-logout logout-button" href="/logout">Log out</a>
        </aside>
        <main class="role-content">
            <div class="role-topline"><div><p class="eyebrow">ADMIN CONTROL ROOM</p><h1>Welcome back, Admin</h1><p class="role-intro">Your central view for people, inventory, suppliers, and sales.</p></div><div class="role-date">System overview</div></div>
            <section class="role-hero admin-hero"><div><span class="hero-kicker">EVERY DETAIL IN VIEW</span><h2>Run the whole lot with confidence.</h2><p>Jump into the records that keep the Car Deals team moving smoothly.</p></div></section>
            <section class="role-cards" aria-label="Admin shortcuts">
                <a class="role-card" href="/employees"><strong>Team</strong><small>Manage employees</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/suppliers"><strong>Suppliers</strong><small>Review partnerships</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/sales"><strong>Sales</strong><small>Inspect transactions</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/add-user"><strong>Add user</strong><small>Approve a registered account by email</small></a>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
